// expect: 42
// The effect-polymorphic absorption crossing a scheme boundary: bracket's
// row is its thunk's row minus the install's handled set (the pending
// mask, diff_row's bound triple), generalized and instantiated at the
// caller. The caller proves `!Ping` — the subtraction must survive
// instantiation (subst_row carries the mask's absent set; the drop was
// measured as Ping leaking here, and as infer_context's three wheel
// callers reading the whole analysis core unsubtracted). The claim is
// `!Ping` and never `Pure`: minting the thunk and installing `pong` each
// allocate, and the row charges both (Hβ.effects.install-allocates-unrowed),
// so the absorption is what this fixture proves.
effect Ping { ping() -> Int }

handler pong {
  ping() => resume(7)
}

fn bracket(body) = body() ~> pong

fn caller() -> Int with !Ping = bracket(() => ping())

fn main() = caller() * 6
